#7250
"A Tiny Path In The Forest"
"A tiny path breaks through the trees to the north.  Sounds rush around you
echoing the voices of those long gone from times long past.  Far to the south,
a large shimmering gem floats high in the air above the path.  West of, a
small stream flows, it's beginning almost at your feet.  The small, flowing
spring is an odd shade of blue; not clear as spring water should be.  To the
east, the woods are dark and uninviting.
"
"North to 7251
"
