#7251
"A Brightly Lit Cloud"
"The area is shockingly bright.  A white haze hangs over everything, reflecting
and intensifying some unknown light source.  The branches of the trees twist
and turn within eachother, interweaving in beautiful patters high above your
head.  A lone altar is clearly visible in the room; it appears unaffected by
the haze.  The trees to the south are silent, though tiny lights appear
through them on occasion.
"
""
