#7252
"A Dark Glade"
"Fireflies dance around the wood merrily, their flickering lights flying around
like tiny, sparkling gems.  The trees hang overhead with such density as to
block out all light from the outside.  Amidst the darkness, the occasional
firefly lights the room with blazing efficiency.  Tiny rock formations scatter
the floor, each about the size of a firefly.  Occasionally, a tiny burst of
light flashes from the ground or the brush, just bright enough to be seen.
"
"- Aeradon - Fireflies call if attacked while sleeping.  When I figure the code out
"
