#7253
"Blue Water Dam"
"A large dam of massive tree trunks curves in an enormous arc around a large
pool of blue water.  It is very difficult to see into the water very far, as
its color masks the depth very well.  Tiny lights from fireflies and other
creatures flicker everywhere aroung you.  They reflect from the surface of the
water, creating a somewhat surreal scene.  Ocassionally, some form of energy
flows through the waters, sending a shimmering blanket ov color cascading
across it's deep blue surface.
"
""
301465604 0
0 9 0
D1
""
""
0 -1 7250 0 6
E
"water"
"The large, blue pool of water spreads outwards to the edges of the dam.  You
can see where the water level has dropped, leaving a blue ring on the dam wall.
"
E
"dam"
"The enormous dam curves around the blue waters.  It may be that the person who
built overdid it a bit.  The dam is far too large for such a small amount of
water.
"
A
"enter wade swim dip jump"
"water pool blue"
"if( cflag( 68, ch ) ) {
  act_tochar( \"You are already in the water.\", ch );
  end;
}
if( is_fighting( ch ) ) {
  end;
}
set_cflag( 68, ch );
act_tochar( #dip1, ch );
act_notchar( #ndip1, ch );
wait( 1 );
act_tochar( #dip2, ch );
act_notchar( #ndip2, ch );
wait( 1 );
if( !rflag( reset0, room ) ) {
  act_tochar( \"You wait patiently, but nothing seems to happen.\", ch );
  end;
}
i = 1d20+10;
act_room( \"The pool shimmers a gentle blue.\", ch );
heal( ch, i );
act_tochar( \"You feel refreshed.\", ch );
remove_rflag( reset0, room );
"
E
"dip1"
"You decide to take a dip into the water and wade in.
"
E
"dip2"
"The water is thicker than it should be, and walking in it is difficult, but
you manage to get into the water about waist deep.
"
E
"dip3"
"As you stand in the water, you feel warm all over, despite the cold touch of
the water.
"
E
"ndip1"
"$n decides to take a dip into the oddly colored waters, walking one step at a
time into it.
"
E
"ndip2"
"$n appears to have some difficulty walking in the water, but manages to get in
waist deep.
"
