""
"A glowing orb of color floats high in the skies just south of you.  A thick
blanket of trees and foliage prevents any further movement toward it.  You can
feel the warm glow of the orb from here, its glow hitting you, sending tiny
rainbows of light across your skin.  The wood thickens a bit to the east.  To
the north, the lighted path emerges from the darkness.
"
""
