""
"The overhanging trees are incredibly thick.  Occasionally, one brief flash of
light will break through to the ground at your feet that immediately
disappears.  The sounds of nighttime fill your ears, though you are honestly
unsure of whether it is due to the actual time of day or the constant darkness
of the wood.  A sharp turn in the path forces you to make a choice; you must
travel further into the darkness to the south or follow the path to the west.
"
