#7261
""
"The darkness breaks away as the tops of the trees open up, letting in the
outside air.  A soft breeze flows down from the sky above.  Two softly glowing
purple lamps float in the air here.  One of them is high in the air close to
the tree tops.  The other hovers over a small sign.  The ground at your feet
is dewey and soft; completely soundless as you take your steps.  To the
southwest, a small cabin can just barely be seen through the thinning trees.
"
""
